## What's new in {{version}}

Version {{version}} ("{{ release.codename }}") ships on {{release.date}}; owners: {{owners}}.

:::note Upgrading to {{version}}
Read the notes for :badge[v{{version}}]{color=indigo} before you upgrade.
:::

- [ ] Announce {{release.codename}} @docs-team :due[{{release.date}}]

| Release     | Code name            |
| ----------- | -------------------- |
| {{version}} | {{release.codename}} |

## Left as written

Write \{{version}} to show the braces, or use code: `{{version}}`.

```handlebars
<h1>{{title}}</h1>
```

Links keep their targets: [notes for {{version}}](https://example.com/releases/{{version}}).

<!-- smd-disable-next-line variable/undefined -->
A name the front matter doesn't define stays as written: {{customer}}.
